---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-09-06';
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms for using PetWellHub pet-care information and site features">
  <article class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-24"><header class="mb-12 border-b border-border pb-8"><p class="mb-3 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent">Legal · Terms</p><h1 class="mb-4 text-5xl font-bold md:text-7xl">Terms of Use</h1><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p></header>
    <div class="prose-article space-y-8 text-[16px] leading-[1.75]">
      <section><h2>1. Acceptance</h2><p>By using petwellhub.org, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the site. Updated terms apply after they are posted on this page.</p></section>
      <section><h2>2. Informational content</h2><p>PetWellHub provides general pet-care education. It does not establish a veterinarian-client-patient relationship and does not provide diagnosis, treatment, prescriptions, medication doses, or individualized emergency instructions.</p></section>
      <section><h2>3. Emergencies</h2><p>Do not delay professional care because of this site. For collapse, breathing difficulty, seizures, severe trauma, suspected poisoning, inability to stand, or rapid deterioration, contact an emergency veterinarian or appropriate animal poison-control service immediately.</p></section>
      <section><h2>4. Responsible use</h2><p>You may use the site for lawful personal information purposes. Do not interfere with site operation, attempt unauthorized access, scrape in a way that disrupts service, or represent PetWellHub content as a veterinary diagnosis.</p></section>
      <section><h2>5. Intellectual property</h2><p>Site text, illustrations, and design elements are protected by copyright or applicable licenses. Limited quotation with attribution is permitted where the law allows; republication or commercial reuse requires permission.</p></section>
      <section><h2>6. External links and commercial relationships</h2><p>External sites control their own content and policies. Advertising or affiliate relationships, when present, are explained in the <a class="underline" href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> and do not convert general information into veterinary advice.</p></section>
      <section><h2>7. No warranty and limitation</h2><p>Information can become outdated or contain errors. To the extent permitted by law, the site is provided without warranties and PetWellHub is not responsible for losses caused by relying on the site instead of obtaining appropriate professional care.</p></section>
      <section><h2>8. Contact</h2><p>Questions about these terms may be sent to <a class="underline" href="mailto:editor@petwellhub.org">editor@petwellhub.org</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
